---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {
  EMAIL,
  EMAIL_URL,
  GITHUB_URL,
  HANDLE,
  LINKEDIN_URL,
  PERSON_NAME,
} from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${PERSON_NAME} | ${HANDLE}.`}>
  <article>
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">RICH BERMAN · GRANOLACOWBOY</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I build and dissect systems. Most of my professional work is legal technology. The rest of my attention tends to land on automation, security, protocols, agents, observability, old software, and the ugly boundaries where systems stop behaving as advertised.</p>
      <p>granolacowboy.dev is a working notebook, not a services site. Projects are here because I wanted to build or test them; client details stay out of it. <a href="https://www.mhsbsolutions.com/">MHSB Solutions</a> is where the consulting work lives.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <ul class="contact-list">
      <li>
        <span class="label">Email</span>
        <a class="data" href={EMAIL_URL}>{EMAIL}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">GitHub</span>
        <a class="data" href={GITHUB_URL}>github.com/{HANDLE}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">LinkedIn</span>
        <a class="data" href={LINKEDIN_URL}>linkedin.com/in/mhsb</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="label">Company</span>
        <a class="data" href="https://www.mhsbsolutions.com/">mhsbsolutions.com</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
